          "heading": "Flying Fijians look to improve on their best world ranking position",
          "body": "The Fiji men’s side historically reached a peak position of No. 7 in the World Rugby rankings back in 2023. As the squad prepares for upcoming fixtures, they currently sit at the bottom of the Nations Championship log. The team has recorded three losses in their three matches played during this competition, having scored 49 points while conceding 145 points throughout the tournament."
