          "kicker": "Refereeing overhaul",
          "heading": "Steve Borthwick secures Premiership refereeing changes for World Cup preparations",
          "body": "Steve Borthwick has secured a significant adjustment to how domestic matches are officiated this season to help align English club rugby with the international game. Following meetings with directors of rugby, the Premiership has agreed to update interpretations for the scrum—specifically the brake-foot law—and the offside line. The England head coach had previously lamented the lack of consistency at the breakdown compared to the international stage, where he aims to mount a serious challenge to South Africa's current dominance."
        },
