          "kicker": "Recent form",
          "heading": "France sustain momentum with two consecutive victories in recent international fixtures",
          "body": "France currently hold a positive record in their recent outings, securing three wins across their last five international matches. The side carries a run of two straight victories into the upcoming period of the season, having most recently defeated Japan 42-15 during their July meeting in the Nations Championship. Across those same five fixtures, the team has maintained a competitive edge as they prepare for their next challenge."
