      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Domestic Setback",
          "heading": "Zebre suffer heavy defeat as Bulls dominate in opening round clash",
          "body": "Zebre Parma endured a challenging start to their United Rugby Championship campaign, falling 47-13 to the Bulls on Saturday. Despite early momentum and two penalties from Tommaso Allan, the hosts could not withstand the visitors' seven-try surge. Alessandro Fusco provided a moment of individual brilliance in the final quarter, stepping over for the home side's only try. The defeat leaves the Italian club reflecting on significant defensive lapses as they prepare for the remainder of their challenging domestic schedule."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
