          "heading": "Santiago Carreras returns to Bath ahead of new club season",
          "body": "Santiago Carreras has returned to club duty with Bath for the opening of the 2026/27 Premiership season. Bath boss Johann van Graan highlighted the character of the Argentine international following his summer period with Los Pumas. Carreras, who arrived at the club from Gloucester in 2025, is currently competing for the full-back position within the squad as the team prepares for their upcoming fixtures. Argentina is next scheduled to face Ireland in Round 4 of the ongoing international competition."
        }
      ],
