          "heading": "Lukhan Salakaia-Loto replaces injured Josh Canham for South Africa Test",
          "body": "The Wallabies have been forced into a late change ahead of their clash with South Africa after Josh Canham was ruled out with a mild hamstring injury. Canham, a key lineout caller, pulled up sore during Friday’s training session. Captain Harry Wilson noted it is “always a big loss” to lose the lock, but added that the side remains confident in the recalled Lukhan Salakaia-Loto. Lachlan Shaw has been added to the matchday bench to provide cover in the tight five."
